      "ui": {},
      "metadata": {},
      "model": "gpt-4o",
      "prompt_template": "Using the following financial data for {{company_name}} ({{ticker}}):\n\n{{financials}}\n\nPerform a thorough fundamental analysis covering:\n1. Revenue & earnings growth trends\n2. Profitability margins (gross, operating, net)\n3. Balance sheet strength (debt, liquidity, equity)\n4. Cash flow quality (FCF yield, capex)\n5. Valuation multiples (P/E, EV/EBITDA, P/S) vs sector peers\n6. Key risks and red flags\n\nProvide a structured summary with a preliminary fundamental outlook (Positive / Neutral / Negative).",
      "system_prompt": "You are a senior equity research analyst specializing in fundamental analysis. Be rigorous, data-driven, and concise.",
      "temperature": 0.2,
      "config": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "prompt_template": "Given the following research data:\n{input}\n\nPerform a thorough fundamental analysis covering:\n1. Revenue & earnings trends\n2. Balance sheet health (debt, cash, liquidity)\n3. Valuation multiples (P/E, EV/EBITDA, P/B)\n4. Growth outlook and competitive moat\n5. Key risks\n\nReturn a structured fundamental analysis report.",
        "system_prompt": "You are a senior equity research analyst specializing in fundamental analysis."
      }
    },
    {
