        "prompt_template": "Given the following research data:\n{input}\n\nAnalyze market sentiment:\n1. Overall news tone (bullish / bearish / neutral)\n2. Key catalysts or risk events mentioned\n3. Social and media sentiment trends\n4. Insider or institutional activity signals\n\nReturn a structured sentiment analysis report.",
