      "prompt_template": "Review the following analyst reports, ratings, and price targets for {{company_name}} ({{ticker}}):\n\n{{analyst_reports}}\n\nSummarize:\n1. Consensus rating (Buy / Hold / Sell) and distribution\n2. Average and range of price targets\n3. Bull case vs bear case arguments from analysts\n4. Recent rating changes or upgrades/downgrades\n5. Key metrics analysts are focused on",
